e the program!\")","identifier":"w6al9lmxt0il-code","enumerator":"12","html_id":"w6al9lmxt0il-code","key":"tMWxO59xZn"},{"type":"outputs","id":"x_4kGxNRYPIkepcHb4lcr","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":"Choose one of the followings (I/D/X): Insert(I)/Delete(D)/Exit(X) ==> i\nType Input Data ==> apple\n1 number of elements, front :  apple , rear :  apple\nChoose one of the followings (I/D/X): Insert(I)/Delete(D)/Exit(X) ==> i\nType Input Data ==> watermelon\n2 number of elements, front :  apple , rear :  watermelon\nChoose one of the followings (I/D/X): Insert(I)/Delete(D)/Exit(X) ==> i\nType Input Data ==> grape\n3 number of elements, front :  apple , rear :  grape\nChoose one of the followings (I/D/X): Insert(I)/Delete(D)/Exit(X) ==> d\nDequeue: removed an element from the front of the queue:  apple\n2 number of elements, front :  watermelon , rear :  grape\nChoose one of the followings (I/D/X): Insert(I)/Delete(D)/Exit(X) ==> i\nType Input Data ==> pineapple\n3 number of elements, front :  watermelon , rear :  pineapple\nChoose one of the followings (I/D/X): Insert(I)/Delete(D)/Exit(X) ==> d\nDequeue: removed an element from the front of the queue:  watermelon\n2 number of elements, front :  grape , rear :  pineapple\nChoose one of the followings (I/D/X): Insert(I)/Delete(D)/Exit(X) ==> x\nTerminate the program!\n"},"children":[],"identifier":"w6al9lmxt0il-outputs-0","html_id":"w6al9lmxt0il-outputs-0","key":"qkF26PvJLA"}],"identifier":"w6al9lmxt0il-outputs","html_id":"w6al9lmxt0il-outputs","key":"wU9NU2zNt7"}],"identifier":"w6al9lmxt0il","label":"W6aL9lmxT0iL","html_id":"w6al9lmxt0il","key":"QLEbMjqVNg"}],"key":"yq1Y0mA4Zt"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}}}